    `notice to show cause served personally` IS TRUE
    `sufficient cause shown` IS FALSE
    `had sufficient means since the order` IS TRUE
    `creditor must deposit subsistence` IS TRUE
    `subsistence deposited` IS TRUE

`a local trader about to flee to dodge judgment` MEANS Defendant WITH
