    `carries on business or ordinarily resides within the jurisdiction` IS TRUE
    `good cause of action shown on oath` IS TRUE
    `acting with intent to prejudice, evade process or obstruct enforcement` IS TRUE
    `has absconded or left Singapore` IS FALSE
    `is about to abscond or leave Singapore` IS TRUE
    `has disposed of or removed property from Singapore` IS FALSE
    `paid the specified sum to the officer` IS FALSE

`the same trader after paying the specified sum` MEANS Defendant WITH
