    `gave, transferred or charged property to defraud creditors` IS FALSE
    `concealed or removed property to defraud creditors` IS TRUE
    `an unsatisfied money judgment exists` IS TRUE
    `concealment was after the judgment` IS FALSE
    `months before the judgment the concealment happened` IS 3

`a debtor who hid property after a judgment he later paid` MEANS Conduct WITH
